OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fdying out this evening. Then the rest
OL,7,Fof the night will be dry with some
OL,8,Flengthy clear periods. A cold night in
OL,9,Fsome sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FAll parts will have a dry
OL,12,Fday with variable amounts of cloud and
OL,13,Fsome sunny spells.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,16,Ffor most of Thursday but rain
OL,17,Fspreading east later in the afternoon
OL,18,Fand evening. Dry with bright spells on
OL,19,FFriday. Rain likely on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
